const description: { en: string; ja: string } = {"en":"Around a four-petalled flower, the four quince lobes carry their curved bands. Straight vine stems run diagonally out from the heart, with pairs of small curls at their tips.","ja":"四枚の花びらを持つ花のまわりに、内側に曲がった帯を持つ四つの裂片を置きます。中央から斜めに直線の蔓を伸ばし、それぞれの先を二つに巻きます。"};

